# Preserve the exact bytes of the accepted source and experimental evidence.
# G3/G4 record SHA-256 of G2 snapshots; EOL conversion would invalidate them.
# -text disables EOL conversion on every OS, even with core.autocrlf=true.
* -text whitespace=blank-at-eol,blank-at-eof,space-before-tab,cr-at-eol
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
